{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_sequence_cache = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    It applies the recurrence relation P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)).\n    \"\"\"\n    if n not in _sequence_cache:\n        p_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n        term1 = sequence(p_n_minus_1)\n        term2 = sequence(n - p_n_minus_1)\n        _sequence_cache[n] = term1 + term2\n        \n    return _sequence_cache[n]"}
