{"task_id": "Mbpp/145", "solution": "def max_Abs_Diff(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum absolute difference between any two elements in the given array.\n    This is achieved by finding the difference between the maximum and minimum elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array) < 2:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input array must contain at least two elements.\")\n\n    min_val = float('inf')\n    max_val = float('-inf')\n\n    for x in array:\n        if x < min_val:\n            min_val = x\n        if x > max_val:\n            max_val = x\n\n    return max_val - min_val"}
