{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Count non-overlapping occurrences of 'std' in input string.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    i = 0\n    pattern = 'std'\n    pattern_len = len(pattern)\n    str_len = len(input_string)\n\n    while i <= str_len - pattern_len:\n        if input_string[i:i+pattern_len] == pattern:\n            count += 1\n            i += pattern_len  # Move past the found pattern to ensure non-overlapping\n        else:\n            i += 1  # Move to the next character\n\n    return count"}
