{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "import math\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of binomial coefficients C(n, k) for even indices k.\n    Assumes n is a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        # Calculate C(n, k) using the factorial formula\n        binomial_coeff = math.factorial(n) // (math.factorial(k) * math.factorial(n - k))\n        total_sum += binomial_coeff\n    return total_sum"}
