{"task_id": "Mbpp/287", "solution": "def _calculate_square(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the square of a given number.\"\"\"\n    return number * number\n\ndef _generate_even_numbers(count: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Generates a list of the first 'count' even natural numbers.\"\"\"\n    return [2 * i for i in range(1, count + 1)]\n\ndef square_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of squares of the first n even natural numbers.\n    For n=2, the even numbers are 2, 4. Their squares are 4, 16. Sum is 20.\n    \"\"\"\n    even_numbers = _generate_even_numbers(n)\n    total_sum_of_squares = 0\n    for num in even_numbers:\n        total_sum_of_squares += _calculate_square(num)\n    return total_sum_of_squares"}
