{"task_id": "Mbpp/391", "solution": "def convert_list_dictionary(list1, list2, list3):\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts three lists into a list of nested dictionaries, structured as {outer_key: {inner_key: value}}.\n    Ensures all input lists have equal lengths before processing.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _validate_input_lengths(l1, l2, l3):\n        \"\"\"Validates that all three input lists have the same length.\"\"\"\n        return len(l1) == len(l2) == len(l3)\n\n    def _create_nested_dict(outer_key, inner_key, value):\n        \"\"\"Creates a single nested dictionary from the given elements.\"\"\"\n        return {outer_key: {inner_key: value}}\n\n    if not _validate_input_lengths(list1, list2, list3):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input lists must have equal lengths.\")\n\n    result = []\n    for i in range(len(list1)):\n        outer_key = list1[i]\n        inner_key = list2[i]\n        value = list3[i]\n        nested_dict = _create_nested_dict(outer_key, inner_key, value)\n        result.append(nested_dict)\n\n    return result"}
