{"task_id": "Mbpp/415", "solution": "def max_Product(array: list[int]) -> tuple[int, int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Find the pair of integers with the highest product from the given array.\n\n    Args:\n        array: List of integers\n\n    Returns:\n        Tuple containing the pair with maximum product\n\n    Raises:\n        ValueError: If array has less than 2 elements\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array) < 2:\n        raise ValueError(\"Array must contain at least 2 elements\")\n\n    max_product = float('-inf')\n    result_pair = (0, 0)\n\n    for i in range(len(array)):\n        for j in range(i + 1, len(array)):\n            product = array[i] * array[j]\n            if product > max_product:\n                max_product = product\n                result_pair = (array[i], array[j])\n\n    return result_pair"}
