{"task_id": "Mbpp/446", "solution": "def _count_element_in_tuple(element, input_tuple):\n    \"\"\"Counts occurrences of a single element in a tuple.\"\"\"\n    return input_tuple.count(element)\n\ndef count_Occurrence(input_tuple, search_elements):\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the total occurrences of all elements from a list within a tuple.\n    It iterates through the search_elements and sums their counts in the input_tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_count = 0\n    for element in search_elements:\n        total_count += _count_element_in_tuple(element, input_tuple)\n    return total_count"}
