{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sum of even factors of a given number.\n    It calculates all factors, filters for even ones, and then sums them.\n    \"\"\"\n    def calculate_factors(num: int) -> list[int]:\n        \"\"\"Calculates all factors for a given number.\"\"\"\n        factors = []\n        for i in range(1, num + 1):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                factors.append(i)\n        return factors\n\n    def is_even(num: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number is even.\"\"\"\n        return num % 2 == 0\n\n    def sum_even_factors(factors_list: list[int]) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Sums all even numbers from a list of factors.\"\"\"\n        even_sum = 0\n        for factor in factors_list:\n            if is_even(factor):\n                even_sum += factor\n        return even_sum\n\n    all_factors = calculate_factors(number)\n    result_sum = sum_even_factors(all_factors)\n    return result_sum"}
