{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "def Find_Min(sublists):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sublist with the minimum length from a list of sublists.\n    Returns the first such sublist encountered if multiple have the same minimum length.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not sublists:\n        return []\n\n    min_sublist = sublists[0]\n    min_length = len(sublists[0])\n\n    for i in range(1, len(sublists)):\n        current_sublist = sublists[i]\n        current_length = len(current_sublist)\n\n        if current_length < min_length:\n            min_length = current_length\n            min_sublist = current_sublist\n            \n    return min_sublist"}
