{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "def pair_xor_Sum(numbers, count):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of XOR operations for all unique pairs of numbers in the given list.\n    The 'count' parameter is unused as the length of 'numbers' can be determined directly.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n    n = len(numbers)\n\n    # Iterate through all unique pairs (i, j) where i < j\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            total_xor_sum += (numbers[i] ^ numbers[j])\n\n    return total_xor_sum"}
