{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "def last(array, element):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the last position (index) of an element in a sorted array using binary search.\n    Returns -1 if the element is not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(array) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] == element:\n            result = mid\n            low = mid + 1  # Try to find further occurrences in the right half\n        elif array[mid] < element:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n    return result"}
